1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,304
Hahahaha!

2
00:00:02,175 --> 00:00:05,261
This is your waterwheel?

3
00:00:06,904 --> 00:00:09,184
Brother, it's turning backward.

4
00:00:09,426 --> 00:00:10,061
Backward…

5
00:00:10,626 --> 00:00:11,683
The blade angle,

6
00:00:12,628 --> 00:00:13,950
is against the current.

7
00:00:14,013 --> 00:00:15,655
Flip them, and it'll turn.

8
00:00:15,865 --> 00:00:17,375
Twelve blades,

9
00:00:17,437 --> 00:00:19,593
all done by sunset?

10
00:00:20,839 --> 00:00:22,306
Drought mission:

11
00:00:22,439 --> 00:00:24,673
expires at sunset today.

12
00:00:24,747 --> 00:00:25,304
Qin Shuang,

13
00:00:25,355 --> 00:00:26,898
three shifts, two hours.

14
00:00:27,218 --> 00:00:28,807
Shift one, into the water!

15
00:00:28,886 --> 00:00:30,664
Shift two, grab the boards!

16
00:00:32,691 --> 00:00:33,385
Four!

17
00:00:34,289 --> 00:00:34,700
Eight.

18
00:00:37,934 --> 00:00:38,739
Twelve,

19
00:00:39,559 --> 00:00:40,900
all flipped!

20
00:00:41,118 --> 00:00:42,925
Elder Han, open the gate.

21
00:00:44,667 --> 00:00:46,464
Turn…

22
00:00:51,088 --> 00:00:52,448
It's turning!

23
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:55,645
Water…

24
00:00:55,987 --> 00:00:57,658
The water's coming!

25
00:00:58,181 --> 00:00:59,471
Mr. Xu.

26
00:00:59,854 --> 00:01:00,954
Up, everyone,

27
00:01:01,028 --> 00:01:02,256
don't kneel!

28
00:01:02,559 --> 00:01:05,176
My… dam…

29
00:01:05,245 --> 00:01:06,294
Squire,

30
00:01:06,530 --> 00:01:08,942
keep your dam for washing your feet.

31
00:01:11,094 --> 00:01:13,386
Drought mission complete.

32
00:01:13,462 --> 00:01:14,929
Rice seed saved.

33
00:01:15,081 --> 00:01:15,969
Drink up.

34
00:01:16,564 --> 00:01:18,441
Brother, now it turns right!

35
00:01:18,511 --> 00:01:19,509
You smiled.

36
00:01:20,230 --> 00:01:20,892
Did not.

37
00:01:23,830 --> 00:01:24,709
Brother…

38
00:01:24,768 --> 00:01:25,639
North.

39
00:01:26,333 --> 00:01:27,286
The wind's cold.

40
00:01:30,011 --> 00:01:30,645
Lo…

41
00:01:31,191 --> 00:01:32,377
Locusts!

42
00:01:35,031 --> 00:01:36,510
Xiaohe, hold on tight.
